  "content": "<p data-pid=\"xacz6kZP\">在知乎上发了两个小项目：</p><h2>人人都是 Thoughts Memo </h2><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/90221\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"AI Works - 知乎\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\"internal\">AI Works - 知乎</a><p data-pid=\"Zv1N7BbH\">这个项目一开始只是我个人备份用的，后来 vibe coding 实在太方便了，就让 codex 写了检索功能，还把文章全部整理到了 NotebookLM，可以很方便地用我们汉化组翻译的内容来写东西，所以就有了这个项目的名称《人人都是 Thoughts Memo 》。</p><h2>日语打字练习</h2><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/210449\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"AI Works - 知乎\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\"internal\">AI Works - 知乎</a><p data-pid=\"OMy2ksQM\">这个是基于 keybr 的盲打练习网站改的日语罗马字输入练习网站，由于我没怎么写过前端代码，所以依然是 codex 代劳，我只负责测试，以及补充一些关键的背景资料。最近进行了重构，之前平假名和片假名共享统计数据，导致系统高估了用户的片假名响应能力，现在这个版本解决了这个问题：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-360f2c3ad96b4a7d32dbf9cb6fede79b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1716\" data-rawheight=\"880\" data-original-token=\"v2-360f2c3ad96b4a7d32dbf9cb6fede79b\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1716\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-360f2c3ad96b4a7d32dbf9cb6fede79b_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1716&#39; height=&#39;880&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1716\" data-rawheight=\"880\" data-original-token=\"v2-360f2c3ad96b4a7d32dbf9cb6fede79b\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1716\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-360f2c3ad96b4a7d32dbf9cb6fede79b_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-360f2c3ad96b4a7d32dbf9cb6fede79b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"3BhmrKux\">除了这两个项目，其实我还 vibe 了挺多日语学习小工具，这里就只发 GitHub 链接了：</p><h2><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/L-M-Sherlock/jlpt-coverage\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">jlpt-coverage</a></h2><p data-pid=\"46kbKRKu\">一个用来标记日语单词对应的 JLPT 等级的小工具，数据源来自 egg rolls 的 JLPT 备考牌组。</p><h2><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/L-M-Sherlock/inline_css_cleanup\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">inline_css_cleanup</a></h2><p data-pid=\"ZU_-R9uX\">一个用来对卡片 css 去重的插件。</p><h2><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/L-M-Sherlock/pin-definition-by-underline\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">pin-definition-by-underline</a></h2><p data-pid=\"gancjpr2\">一个用来帮我置顶日语卡片中词典释义的小脚本。</p><h2><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/L-M-Sherlock/japanese-reading-stats\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">japanese-reading-stats</a></h2><p data-pid=\"4bIx5zLJ\">一个用来可视化我日语阅读记录的小脚本。</p><h2><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/L-M-Sherlock/japanese-mining-report\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">japanese-mining-report</a></h2><p data-pid=\"9AT0fOIi\">一个用来可视化我日语查词背词记录的小脚本。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"F-a55c-O\">自从用了 codex，感觉已经工具自由了，以前觉得写起来很麻烦的小工具，现在直接让 codex 写就完事了。除了这些小工具，我还用 codex 给各种开源的日语学习工具交过好几个 PR，都是用来改进平时日语学习工作流的，比如：</p><p data-pid=\"7OqkIkMO\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/Sirush/Jiten/pull/280\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Add subtitle mora stats for media decks</a></p><p data-pid=\"QhuKII1j\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/Manhhao/Hoshi-Reader/pull/23\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Align frequency harmonic rank calculation</a></p><p data-pid=\"Ym5P7I-f\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/asbplayer/asbplayer/pull/885\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Improve freeflow immersion: Jump To seeks playback and keep scroll position</a></p><p data-pid=\"J4Fd2H6Z\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/Manhhao/Hoshi-Reader/pull/17\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Normalize reading and relax audio lookup</a></p><p data-pid=\"TJGcksLT\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/yomidevs/yomitan/pull/2333\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Add -やがる deinflection and expand test coverage</a></p><p data-pid=\"sDtLZraa\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/asbplayer/asbplayer/pull/953\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Show mining history count and fix stale jump target after seek</a></p><p data-pid=\"a9W-jYgg\">反正都是随手的事情。以前都说磨刀不误砍柴工，但是磨刀太费时间也不行。现在 AI 磨刀可快了，我就能专注砍柴了（bushi</p>",
